---
description: >-
  with markdownAlwaysOn, every state label is markdown: a leading "- " or
  "* " makes a list item, backticks draw inline code, and bold and italic
  are read, in state text, transition text, notes and the lines of a state
  with several descriptions (#763, #1368)
config:
  markdownAlwaysOn: true
---
stateDiagram-v2
  A: - one
  B: * two
  A --> B : - item
  C --> D : `code`
  D --> E : **bold** and *italic*
  note right of A
    - note item
  end note
  note left of C : a `note` in backticks
  F: first line
  F: second **line**
